<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">

  <meta
    name="viewport"
    content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"
  >

  <meta
    name="description"
    content="Food for My Love is a collection of Nicaraguan recipes created by John Stout for his husband, Yonathan Serrano."
  >

  <title>Food for My Love | Nicaraguan Recipes</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --blue: #0b5fad;
      --dark-blue: #073b70;
      --light-blue: #eaf4ff;
      --cream: #fffaf1;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --text: #17202a;
      --muted: #667085;
      --border: #e3ddd4;
      --accent: #d96745;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      background: var(--cream);
      color: var(--text);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
    }

    button,
    input,
    select {
      font: inherit;
    }

    .top-navigation {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 20;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.96);
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
    }

    .navigation-inner {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 16px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 20px;
    }

    .brand {
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 21px;
      font-weight: 800;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    .navigation-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .navigation-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 720px;
      padding: 85px 22px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      background:
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 15% 20%,
          rgba(11, 95, 173, 0.14),
          transparent 34%
        ),
        radial-gradient(
          circle at 85% 15%,
          rgba(217, 103, 69, 0.12),
          transparent 32%
        ),
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          #edf6ff,
          #fffaf1,
          #fff1e9
        );
    }

    .hero-content {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 850px;
    }

    .hero-label {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 9px 17px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 24px 0 20px;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      font-size: clamp(48px, 10vw, 82px);
      line-height: 1.04;
    }

    .hero-description {
      max-width: 720px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: clamp(19px, 3vw, 24px);
    }

    .dedication {
      margin: 25px auto 0;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 19px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .button-group {
      margin-top: 34px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 15px 25px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      border-radius: 13px;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .primary-button {
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .primary-button:hover {
      background: var(--dark-blue);
    }

    .secondary-button {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--blue);
      border-color: var(--border);
    }

    .section {
      max-width: 1150px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 78px 22px;
    }

    .section-heading {
      margin: 0 0 14px;
      font-size: clamp(34px, 6vw, 48px);
      line-height: 1.15;
    }

    .section-description {
      max-width: 800px;
      margin: 0 0 30px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .story-section {
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .story-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.4fr 0.8fr;
      gap: 28px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .story-text {
      font-size: 18px;
    }

    .dedication-card {
      padding: 28px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--cream);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .dedication-card .heart {
      display: block;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      font-size: 40px;
    }

    .dedication-card blockquote {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--dark-blue);
      font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
      font-size: 24px;
      font-style: italic;
    }

    .dedication-card cite {
      display: block;
      margin-top: 12px;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-style: normal;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .feature-grid {
      margin-top: 35px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 18px;
    }

    .feature-card {
      padding: 24px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 17px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .feature-icon {
      font-size: 32px;
    }

    .feature-card h3 {
      margin: 12px 0 7px;
      color: var(--blue);
    }

    .feature-card p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .recipe-tools {
      margin: 30px 0;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 260px;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .recipe-tools label {
      position: absolute;
      width: 1px;
      height: 1px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .recipe-tools input,
    .recipe-tools select {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 15px 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 17px;
    }

    .recipe-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
      gap: 19px;
    }

    .recipe-card {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      overflow: hidden;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 18px;
      background: var(--white);
    }

    .recipe-image {
      min-height: 150px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      background:
        linear-gradient(
          135deg,
          var(--light-blue),
          #fff1e9
        );
      font-size: 58px;
    }

    .recipe-content {
      padding: 20px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .recipe-category {
      align-self: flex-start;
      padding: 5px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--light-blue);
      color: var(--blue);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .recipe-content h3 {
      margin: 12px 0 8px;
      font-size: 22px;
      line-height: 1.25;
    }

    .recipe-content p {
      margin: 0 0 18px;
      color: var(--muted);
      flex: 1;
    }

    .recipe-link {
      display: block;
      padding: 11px 14px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--blue);
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-weight: 800;
    }

    .recipe-link:hover {
      background: var(--dark-blue);
    }

    .no-results {
      display: none;
      padding: 35px;
      border: 1px dashed var(--border);
      border-radius: 15px;
      color: var(--muted);
      text-align: center;
    }

    .book-section {
      text-align: center;
      background: var(--dark-blue);
      color: var(--white);
    }

    .book-section .section-description {
      margin-right: auto;
      margin-left: auto;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.82);
    }

    .book-section .secondary-button {
      border-color: var(--white);
    }

    footer {
      padding: 30px 20px;
      background: #052b53;
      color: var(--white);
      text-align: center;
    }

    @media (max-width: 850px) {
      .story-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .feature-grid,
      .recipe-grid {
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 650px) {
      .navigation-links {
        display: none;
      }

      .hero {
        min-height: 680px;
        padding: 70px 20px;
      }

      .section {
        padding: 62px 20px;
      }

      .button {
        width: 100%;
      }

      .recipe-tools {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .feature-grid,
      .recipe-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <nav class="top-navigation">
    <div class="navigation-inner">

      <a class="brand" href="#home">
        Food for My Love
      </a>

      <div class="navigation-links">
        <a href="#story">Our Story</a>
        <a href="#recipes">Recipes</a>
        <a href="#book">The Book</a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero" id="home">
    <div class="hero-content">

      <span class="hero-label">
        Nicaraguan Recipes in the United States
      </span>

      <h1>Food for My Love</h1>

      <p class="hero-description">
        A collection of Nicaraguan recipes created with love
        by John Stout for his husband, Yonathan Serrano.
      </p>

      <p class="dedication">
        “For Yonathan, with all my love.”
        <br>
        — John
      </p>

      <div class="button-group">

        <a class="button primary-button" href="#recipes">
          Explore Recipes
        </a>

        <a
          class="button secondary-button"
          href="Food for my love.pdf"
          target="_blank"
        >
          Read the Complete Book
        </a>

      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="story-section" id="story">
    <div class="section">

      <div class="story-grid">

        <div>
          <h2 class="section-heading">
            The Story Behind the Book
          </h2>

          <div class="story-text">
            <p>
              Food for My Love began as a gift of love from
              John Stout to his husband, Yonathan Serrano.
            </p>

            <p>
              John created this book to celebrate Yonathan’s
              Nicaraguan roots and to bring together the flavors,
              memories, and traditions of Nicaraguan cuisine in
              one special place.
            </p>

            <p>
              More than a collection of recipes, this book
              represents love, family, cultural heritage, and a
              connection to home, even while living far from
              Nicaragua.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <aside class="dedication-card">
          <span class="heart">♥</span>

          <blockquote>
            “May these recipes always bring you closer to home.”
          </blockquote>

          <cite>
            From John to Yonathan
          </cite>
        </aside>

      </div>

      <div class="feature-grid">

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon">📖</span>

          <h3>82 Recipes</h3>

          <p>
            A wide collection of traditional Nicaraguan dishes.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon">🇳🇮</span>

          <h3>Nicaraguan Heritage</h3>

          <p>
            Recipes that preserve culture, memories, and family
            traditions.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article class="feature-card">
          <span class="feature-icon">♥</span>

          <h3>Created with Love</h3>

          <p>
            A personal gift created by John for his husband,
            Yonathan.
          </p>
        </article>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="recipes">

    <h2 class="section-heading">
      Explore the Recipes
    </h2>

    <p class="section-description">
      Search by recipe name or select a category. Each recipe
      opens directly to its corresponding page in the complete
      cookbook.
    </p>

    <div class="recipe-tools">

      <label for="recipeSearch">
        Search recipes
      </label>

      <input
        id="recipeSearch"
        type="search"
        placeholder="Search for rice, shrimp, beef..."
      >

      <label for="categoryFilter">
        Select a category
      </label>

      <select id="categoryFilter">
        <option value="all">All Categories</option>
        <option value="rice">Rice</option>
        <option value="meat">Meat</option>
        <option value="seafood">Seafood</option>
        <option value="vegetables">Vegetables</option>
      </select>

    </div>

    <div class="recipe-grid" id="recipeGrid">

      <article
        class="recipe-card"
        data-name="Arroz Ancha"
        data-category="rice"
      >
        <div class="recipe-image">🍚</div>

        <div class="recipe-content">
          <span class="recipe-category">Rice</span>

          <h3>Arroz Ancha</h3>

          <p>
            A rich and flavorful rice dish prepared with coconut
            milk, vegetables, and traditional spices.
          </p>

          <a
            class="recipe-link"
            href="Food for my love.pdf#page=1"
            target="_blank"
          >
            View Recipe
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article
        class="recipe-card"
        data-name="Arroz Aguado"
        data-category="rice"
      >
        <div class="recipe-image">🍲</div>

        <div class="recipe-content">
          <span class="recipe-category">Rice</span>

          <h3>Arroz Aguado</h3>

          <p>
            A comforting Nicaraguan rice dish with a rich broth,
            vegetables, and tender meat.
          </p>

          <a
            class="recipe-link"
            href="Food for my love.pdf#page=2"
            target="_blank"
          >
            View Recipe
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article
       